  "text": "Here is the bulletproof offboarding protocol every mature agency needs to implement. Client churn is inevitable, but mishandling departures burns bridges and leaves your team in complete disarray. Without a standardized offboarding protocol, staff waste hours guessing which tools, permissions, and client subscriptions to cancel. Deploy an automated Airtable pipeline that handles asset transfers, archives shared Slack channels, and cancels recurring subscriptions. You protect agency profitability while preserving executive relationships.",
